        a                       ecrm:E12_Production ;
        rdfs:comment            "This textile belongs to Group 3 as defined by Jennifer Wearden,  'Azerbaijanian Embroideries: A Synthesis of Contrasts', <i>Hali</i> 59 (October 1991) pp. 102-111.\r\nGroup 3 textiles are characterised by surface darning on the diagonal and date from the middle of the 18th century into the early part of the 19th century." ;
